NON-CLINICAL RESEARCH PROTOTYPE NOTICE:
This software and associated model weights are experimental research prototypes
designed for low-demand communication exploration. They are not medical devices,
not validated therapeutic interventions, and not a replacement for clinical care.
Anyone experiencing thoughts of self-harm or acute distress should contact local
emergency services or verified crisis lifelines (e.g., Tele-MANAS 14416 in India,
988 in the US, Samaritans 116 123 in the UK, or findahelpline.com).

THIRD-PARTY DATASET LICENSING:
Portions of the training data curation pipeline optionally reference open
counseling datasets including `Amod/mental_health_counseling_conversations`,
which is governed by the RAIL-D (Responsible AI License - Dataset). Commercial
use or redistribution must comply with the specific terms of the respective source licenses.
